<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Mumbai Resto — The Future of Hospitality</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/main.css">
</head>
<body>
    <canvas id="particle-canvas"></canvas>

    <nav class="nav">
        <div class="logo" style="font-weight: 600; font-size: 18px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-plum-voltage)" stroke-width="2">
                <path d="M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5zM2 17l10 5 10-5M2 12l10 5 10-5"/>
            </svg>
            MUMBAI RESTO
        </div>
        <div class="nav-links">
            <a href="#features" class="nav-link">Features</a>
            <a href="#pricing" class="nav-link">Pricing</a>
            <a href="#faq" class="nav-link">FAQ</a>
            <a href="/admin/login" class="nav-link">Log In</a>
            <a href="/register" class="btn-primary" style="margin-left: 20px;">Get Started</a>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <main class="container">
        <section class="hero">
            <div class="hero-content">
                <span class="eyebrow" style="color: #ffffff;">STOP MANAGING KNOWLEDGE. START USING IT.</span>
                <h1 class="display-headline">Your restaurant deserves a digital soul.</h1>
                <p class="body-text">QR table ordering, online bookings, beautiful storefronts, and a powerful admin dashboard. Everything Indian restaurants need to thrive in the digital age.</p>
                <div style="display: flex; gap: 15px;">
                    <a href="/register" class="btn-primary">Start Your Free Trial</a>
                    <button class="btn-ghost" style="border-radius: 24px; border: 1px solid var(--color-ash); color: #ffffff; background: transparent; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; padding: 14px 16px; cursor: pointer;">See How It Works</button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="features" class="section">
            <span class="eyebrow">Features</span>
            <h2 class="display-headline" style="font-size: var(--text-display); margin-bottom: 60px;">Everything your restaurant needs.</h2>

            <div class="grid">
                <div class="card">
                    <span class="eyebrow" style="color: var(--color-lichen);">01</span>
                    <h3 style="font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 12px; font-weight: 600;">QR Table Ordering</h3>
                    <p style="color: var(--color-smoke); font-size: 15px;">Diners scan, browse, and order directly from their phone. No app download needed.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="card">
                    <span class="eyebrow" style="color: var(--color-amber-spark);">02</span>
                    <h3 style="font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 12px; font-weight: 600;">Table Booking System</h3>
                    <p style="color: var(--color-smoke); font-size: 15px;">Manage availability and party sizes effortlessly with instant confirmation.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="card">
                    <span class="eyebrow" style="color: var(--color-plum-voltage);">03</span>
                    <h3 style="font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 12px; font-weight: 600;">Payments Built In</h3>
                    <p style="color: var(--color-smoke); font-size: 15px;">Accept UPI, cards, and wallets via Razorpay. Zero platform commission.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="card">
                    <span class="eyebrow">04</span>
                    <h3 style="font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 12px; font-weight: 600;">Kitchen Display</h3>
                    <p style="color: var(--color-smoke); font-size: 15px;">Real-time order queue for your kitchen staff. Track fulfillment instantly.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="card">
                    <span class="eyebrow">05</span>
                    <h3 style="font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 12px; font-weight: 600;">5 Beautiful Themes</h3>
                    <p style="color: var(--color-smoke); font-size: 15px;">Choose from Classic to Zen Minimal. Each template is mobile-optimized.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="card">
                    <span class="eyebrow">06</span>
                    <h3 style="font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 12px; font-weight: 600;">Multi-Branch</h3>
                    <p style="color: var(--color-smoke); font-size: 15px;">Manage multiple outlets from one dashboard with unified reporting.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="pricing" class="section" style="text-align: center;">
            <span class="eyebrow">Pricing</span>
            <h2 class="display-headline" style="font-size: var(--text-display);">Simple, transparent pricing.</h2>
            <p class="body-text" style="margin: 0 auto 60px;">Start free for 14 days. No credit card required. Zero commission on orders.</p>

            <div class="grid">
                <div class="card">
                    <h3 style="font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px;">Free</h3>
                    <div style="font-size: 36px; font-weight: 200; margin-bottom: 24px;">₹0<span style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--color-smoke);">/month</span></div>
                    <ul style="text-align: left; color: var(--color-smoke); font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 30px;">
                        <li>• 1 branch</li>
                        <li>• 30 menu items</li>
                        <li>• 10 tables</li>
                        <li>• Email support</li>
                    </ul>
                    <a href="/register?plan=free" class="btn-primary" style="width: 100%;">Get Started</a>
                </div>
                <div class="card" style="border-color: var(--color-plum-voltage);">
                    <span class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom: 8px;">Most Popular</span>
                    <h3 style="font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px;">Pro</h3>
                    <div style="font-size: 36px; font-weight: 200; margin-bottom: 24px;">₹999<span style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--color-smoke);">/month</span></div>
                    <ul style="text-align: left; color: var(--color-smoke); font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 30px;">
                        <li>• 3 branches</li>
                        <li>• Unlimited items</li>
                        <li>• Custom domain</li>
                        <li>• Priority support</li>
                    </ul>
                    <a href="/register?plan=pro" class="btn-primary" style="width: 100%;">Start Free Trial</a>
                </div>
                <div class="card">
                    <h3 style="font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px;">Starter</h3>
                    <div style="font-size: 36px; font-weight: 200; margin-bottom: 24px;">₹499<span style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--color-smoke);">/month</span></div>
                    <ul style="text-align: left; color: var(--color-smoke); font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 30px;">
                        <li>• 1 branch</li>
                        <li>• 100 menu items</li>
                        <li>• All themes</li>
                        <li>• 3 staff accounts</li>
                    </ul>
                    <a href="/register?plan=starter" class="btn-primary" style="width: 100%;">Start Free Trial</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="section" style="text-align: center; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 40px; padding: 80px 40px;">
            <h2 class="display-headline" style="font-size: 48px;">Ready to digitize your restaurant?</h2>
            <p class="body-text" style="margin: 0 auto 36px;">Join hundreds of Indian restaurants already using Mumbai Resto. Start your 14-day free trial today.</p>
            <a href="/register" class="btn-primary" style="font-size: 18px; padding: 20px 40px;">Start Your Free Trial</a>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="footer">
        <div class="container" style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
            <div>© 2026 MUMBAI RESTO. MADE WITH ❤️ IN INDIA.</div>
            <div style="display: flex; gap: 24px;">
                <a href="#">Privacy</a>
                <a href="#">Terms</a>
                <a href="#">Contact</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </footer>

    <script src="/js/particles.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
